    "description": "SOME ITEMS CONTAIN AGE/WEAR/DAMAGE/STAINS/DINGS/DENTS\nALL ITEMS SOLD AS IS\nTitle\n: Arlington Canterbury Everyman Falcon Missouri Meerschaum Smoking Pipes Lot Wood\nBrand\n: Multiple\nModel\n: Assorted - - Arlington, Falcon, Canrebury, Starfire, London  Rival, The Everyman, Missouri Meerschaum (X 2), Qty 9\nColor\n: Brown/Amber/Black\nDescription\n: This mixed lot features nine unique vintage smoking pipes, ideal for collectors or those seeking a blend of classic tobacciana. Included are briar, corn cob, and cherry wood pipes, with visible makers such as Arlington, Canterbury, Everyman London, Falcon, and Missouri Meerschaum. Each pipe boasts its own style, from straight and bent stems to a Falcon metal pipe with a wooden bowl, as well as two iconic Missouri Meerschaum corn cob pipes with amber-toned stems. Materials range from traditional briarwood and cherrywood to metal and natural corn cob. Most pipes show use, some with surface wear or patina, offering authentic vintage character. These pieces are perfect for display, restoration projects, or as a diverse starter collection. Please note wear and character marks; pipes are sold as seen. See photos for details of each unique pipe included\nSOME ITEMS CONTAIN AGE/WEAR/DAMAGE/STAINS/DINGS/DENTS\nALL ITEMS SOLD AS IS\nLytle\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books and internet\nHowever, we are NOT experts in any field\nAll measurements for items are approximated\nGoodwill helps change lives\nthrough the power of work!\nThanks for shopping\nGoodwill Industries Of San Antonio!\nTerms of Sale\nOrders must be paid for within ten (10) days from the close of auction, unless other arrangements have been agreed upon.  All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be resold without further notice.",
